<title>USA: Vail Resorts Inc Q2 March 31 shr $1.42.</title>
<headline>Vail Resorts Inc Q2 March 31 shr $1.42.</headline>
<dateline>VAIL, Colo. 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.42		    $1.31</p>
<p> Net			 48,938		   45,025</p>
<p> Revs		     179,008		  164,120</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  34,429		   34,345</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: Pro forma results assume Vail's IPO and the acquisition of Breckenridge and Keystone resorts occurred at the beginning of the periods presented, rather than the actual January 3, 1997 acquisition date and the February 4, 1997 IPO date. Pro forma results also exclude the operations of Arapahoe Basin which is to be divested pursuant to a consent decree with the Department of Justice.  </p>
<p>NOTE: First Call analysts' estimate $1.37.</p>
